<description>&lt;p&gt;Drone attacks launched from Ethiopia have struck near Sudan's capital, killing four and damaging a UN building, while Sudanese forces intercepted additional drones aimed at Khartoum. Clashes in southern Ethiopia have displaced around 700,000 people and spilled across the border into Kenya, prompting a UK travel warning for Moyale and a US travel alert over border fighting and troop build-up. A Kenyan priest called for continued welcome of refugees fleeing the fighting, and a US legislator proposed linking trade incentives to peace with Ethiopia and Eritrea. The conflict caused 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxNbkxqb0VrZjlDdHZQYVBMUjFvclVSNHJET1FhSXV5SHRXS1R0R3FFS2ZndjZudVc1RWFzZXZVQUhFSktZcVpsdU9RWG01QVNHVlVuMjBvT0liUGVELUdta093MmtqWndvM0lZR09nS0dteUlzd0JRX3htbWk2Y0U4SXM5MFJMWG92cXJEWHMwY1lUOC03ajVsQm9XRzQ1bVk3TGVZMUZaallEZVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Ethiopia Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxPbEk4ZmpVdWlfUW8zOHlwSWNWMjFMQVk4M0xKdXJJRXNBbUJpVFVpT1JSMUFXd2xGR1g4U0NTNTZwRlpFMXJRV1R3ZFpmaXVXaUYyaEc5bnF5ejJyQy1GZ216UDAxOHVOVzAtWmxjVnZlY3ZnX0NqRnljZG5QWTZMYWVaUWRWaTdTalhSUnNscTNpRWZlTDdGeXY2WFU4ak5pa2lqWS1SRk56elM5MjVjQnJRbTRNQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;EWTN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxNNGdHOTFpWkRzb0xudHlKeHQzTzkzdzM1dzlRRVkwNlhPNUdFMWI1a0VwMFFxbzYxc3R5dzdKb1JDaFpBTGNSLTZGTDcxU2l2cllocG1tN1hiSlJFMHlxWXpRX0NfNlQ5Y2F3ZDRpSXNPQ1hkYXg4dnNyZXJiMk10WXlWWUw1Y1RidE84c0E4TFBRTGxtWFg0MHhpcTNoclVnUzNVV3FRVExoNlJTNURRaFBHa3RGazZONU1IbkNkalZSUkk0NmxBOHNn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTFB2cnU0VG9nNHlWR2x2SjNTXy1BdTRqOFFnQUNHeTQxeXRkQXNJNFVYci1CWlZJMExpTkN2UV9Mb3U3R1dSQVJ